# Cloudflare Pages reads this from the root of the deployed directory. One rule per line:
#   <from>  <to>  <status>
# This file is for REDIRECTS only; caching and security headers live in _headers.

# /2020 was a live year page until the year floor moved to 2021 on 17 Sep 2026. Those
# books are still on the site — in the library, on their theme pages and in the
# connection map — they simply no longer get a year page of their own. Send the old URL
# to the timeline rather than let a formerly-indexed page 404.
/2020      /timeline  301
/2020/*    /timeline  301
